# User Prompt

## Buyer Message
> {{ buyer_message }}

---

{% if product_context %}
## product_context
{{ product_context }}

---
{% endif %}

{% if order_context %}
## order_context
{{ order_context }}

---
{% endif %}

## Instruction
Analyze the buyer message above.
Use `product_context` and `order_context` if provided to improve accuracy.
Return your analysis as a JSON object following the output format in the system prompt.
